1
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:24,000
In space there is no daylight.

2
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:42,000
Dracula 3000 is a horror, science fiction film directed by Darrell James Roodt.

3
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:00,000
In the year 3000, the deep space salvage ship Mother III locates the
vanished starship Demeter in the Carpathian System.

4
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
Captain Abraham Van Helsing and his crew composed of the blonde assistant Aurora Ash; the crippled navigator Arthur "The Professor" Holmwood, who believes
that he is a genius; the strong and dumb Humvee; the intern Mina Murry; and the drug addicted 187, decide to claim the possession of Demeter.

5
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:36,000
While exploring the spacecraft, they see a tape of fifty years ago of Captain Varna telling that he was locked in
his cabin since his crew was acting weird after getting a cargo of coffins in Transylvania station.

6
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:54,000
When 187 decides to search in the coffins for some possible hidden dope,
he cuts his hand and his blood awakes Count Orlock, a.k.a.

7
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:12,000
Count Dracula.

8
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:30,000
When Aurora discloses who Dracula is, the survivors try
to find a way to destroy the vampire.

9
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:48,000
Capt. Abraham Van Helsing, played by Casper Van Dien.

10
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:06,000
Aurora Ash, played by Erika Eleniak.

11
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:24,000
Mina Murry, played by Alexandra Kamp.

12
00:51:36,000 --> 00:51:42,000
187, played by Coolio.

13
00:55:54,000 --> 00:56:00,000
Arthur "The Professor" Holmwood, played by Grant Swanby.

14
01:00:12,000 --> 01:00:18,000
Orlock, played by Langley Kirkwood.

15
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
Dracula 3000 (stylized as DRACULA.3000, and also known as Dracula 3000: Infinite Darkness) is a
2004 made-for-television science fiction horror film directed by Darrell Roodt.

16
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
An international co-production of Germany and South Africa, it is an adaptation of
Bram Stoker's novel Dracula in the futuristic setting of outer space.

17
01:13:06,000 --> 01:13:12,000
Despite its title, the film is not connected to the Dracula 2000 series.

18
01:17:24,000 --> 01:17:30,000
The film explores themes of space marine, vampire,
matter of life and death, dracula.

19
01:21:42,000 --> 01:21:48,000
The tone is dark and thought_provoking.
